{
  "key": 8705,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, you have a Pokétch?\n",
        "You will find it indispensable.\r",
        "Science will become increasingly\n",
        "necessary in the world of Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "My name is Cyrus.\r",
        "I am but another human seeking to\n",
        "become Sinnoh’s greatest Trainer.\r",
        "If you’re also a Trainer, then do\n",
        "your best to gain power.\r",
        "Be all that you can become."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00002",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00003",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00004",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Aren’t we Team Galactic?\n",
        "And we’re assigned here?\r",
        "Standing around among flowers...\n",
        "This doesn’t seem all that cool.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: Hey now! Don’t complain.\n",
        "This is a pretty decent assignment.\r",
        "But Bug- and Grass-type\n",
        "Pokémon so creep me out...\r",
        "I don’t like being here either."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I wanted to get some flowers from\n",
        "the Floaroma Meadow...\r",
        "But some Team Galactic guys in\n",
        "snazzy outfits came along...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Those Galactic guys went to the\n",
        "meadow past these flowers here..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Being surrounded by flowers puts me\n",
        "in an oddly pleasant mood."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "I simply love it here...\n",
        "The atmosphere is so uplifting.\r",
        "You came to get emotionally healed\n",
        "too, didn’t you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Floaroma, the town of\n",
        "flowers, flowers, and more flowers!\r",
        "You should plant some flowers of\n",
        "your own, too. Yay for flowers!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The Berries you pick can be used as\n",
        "food for Pokémon.\r",
        "You can also exchange them at\n",
        "the florist’s for Accessories to\\fdress up your Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "I got drawn here by the sweet scent\n",
        "of Honey...\r",
        "Seriously, what’s that? What am I?\n",
        "A Pokémon or something? Mmm... Honey."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Floaroma Town\n",
        "Vivid & Scented"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Pick a Peck of Colors Flower Shop\n",
        "Free Berries Available"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0919_ST03_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Floaroma Meadow Ahead\n",
        "Honey Available"
      ]
    }
  ]
}